  "craft": {
    "description": "Craft an unlocked real recipe using player 2x2 or workbench. Opens a nearby visible workbench; if absent, can safely place one owned workbench after reserving all recipe ingredients. Never fabricates a missing station. count is requested minimum newly gained output. Confirms inventory increase.",
