  "rename": {
    "description": "Rename the single input stack in an open anvil and return it to the inventory using normal anvil XP costs. Put the item in slot 0 with slot 1 empty first. Empty name removes its custom name. Verifies server output and final inventory; already matching names cost no XP.",
