  "build": {
    "description": "Choose cells OR box, never both. box{x,y,z,width,height,length,block,mode} expands a rectangular part: solid(default)=filled floor/roof/prism; walls=vertical perimeter with empty interior, no floor/roof. Each part still expands to <=32 TARGET cells, extent <=16/axis, within 32 blocks. Compose parts with plan. block=minecraft:air clears named space first by normal mining; existing visible air is satisfied. Other targets never implicitly excavate solid terrain. Actual sight, owned materials/tools and server receipts required. <=5 approaches; supports may consume extra materials. No hidden scan, files, scripts or substitutions. Precise place controls orientation.",
