  "waitUntil": {
    "description": "Wait locally for observed daylight/night or own health/food >=minimum, up to ticks (20/s). Actual sky or an owned clock is required for daylight; under an opaque roof without a clock returns condition_unobservable immediately. Timeout is failure, never evidence that the expected condition happened. Pauses, reflexes, stop and takeover remain authoritative. Use wait only for intentional elapsed-time rest, not an assumed change.",
